  "mn126:19.1": "Above, Jayasena expresses his confidence in the Buddha, but not in Bhūmija (<a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn126/en/sujato#5.1'>MN 126:5.1</a>). ",
  "mn126:19.2": "As at <a href='https://suttacentral.net/mn125/en/sujato#11.2'>MN 125:11.2</a>. ",
